{
  "title": "金融时报 | 专家共话数字金融助力新质生产力发展",
  "description": "",
  "content": "<div class=\"newsxq\"> <div class=\"fhan\"> <div class=\"container\"> <p><a href=\"javascript:;\" onclick=\"javascript:history.back(-1);return false;\">返回<img src=\"../../../../static/home/images/tu14.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></p> </div> </div> <div class=\"xq_nr\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"xqnr\"> <div class=\"xq_l\"> <div class=\"xq_rq\"><span>19</span><font>2024.07</font></div> <div class=\"xq_l_l\"> <h2>金融时报 | 专家共话数字金融助力新质生产力发展</h2> <b>2024.07.19</b> <h1 class=\"rich_media_title \" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 22px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; text-indent: 0em; caret-color: red;\">新质生产力写入2024年《政府工作报告》，并被列为2024年十大工作任务的首位。业内人士认为，科技创新是发展新质生产力的核心要素，在这一过程中，需要大力发展数字经济，而数字金融正是数字技术不断向金融领域渗透，与数字经济高度契合的金融新形态。如何因地制宜发展新质生产力，让数字金融在金融数据和数字技术的双轮驱动下，推动数字经济和实体经济深度融合成为金融行业必答题。</span></h1><h1 class=\"rich_media_title \" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 22px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;\"><strong style=\"font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong style=\"font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(192, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">万里数据库深度研究金融行业应用场景，洞悉客户痛点需求</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify;\">，</span>基于万里数据库在金融信创领域沉淀的核心能力与定制化解决方案</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">，GreatDB及相关产品广泛应用于<strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(192, 0, 0);\">国有大型银行、股份制银行、城市商业银行、证券机构</span></strong>等金</span><span style=\"font-family: sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">融多维业务领域，实现了业务多点开花与布局。帮助金融行业客户实现业务数智化升级，真正做到技术与金融的深度融合，推动新质生产力高质量发展。</span></h1><h1 class=\"rich_media_title \" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 22px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family: sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">基于此，《金融时报》邀请国家金融与发展实验室副主任杨涛、中央财经大学中国互联网经济研究院副院长欧阳日辉、湖南大学金融与统计学院副教授明雷共同探讨数字金融如何助力新质生产力发展。</span></h1><section><section><section><section><section><p style=\"line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; text-indent: 0em; caret-color: red; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; visibility: visible;\"></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><br/></section><section><section>主持人</section><section><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">胡 萍</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;《金融时报》记者</section></section></section></section><section><section><br/></section></section><section><section><section><br/></section><section><section>访谈嘉宾</section><section><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; text-align: justify; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; visibility: visible;\">杨 涛</span></strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); visibility: visible;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>国家金融与发展实验室副主任</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; text-align: justify; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; visibility: visible;\">欧阳日辉</span></strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); visibility: visible;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>中央财经大学中国互联网经济研究院副院长</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; text-align: justify; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; visibility: visible;\">明 雷</span></strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); visibility: visible;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>湖南大学金融与统计学院副教授</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/5W3cq2dzJ1QEf4Edj188j3vGEXQVfTr37F1XcczUB4wu9DjB1sxHJxJvpjgXcbAJYsH2WFHySjdjxNZvDnt5Qg/640?from=appmsg&wxfrom=5&wx_lazy=1&wx_co=1&wx_fmt=other&tp=webp\" class=\"\" alt=\"图片\"/></section><section><section><section><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">问：您如何认识新质生产力？</strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><br/></p></section><section><p style=\"margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\">杨涛：</span></strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\">习近平总书记在黑龙江考察时提出了新质生产力。今年1月，习近平总书记在中共中央政治局第十一次集体学习时强调，“发展新质生产力是推动高质量发展的内在要求和重要着力点”“它由技术革命性突破、生产要素创新性配置、产业深度转型升级而催生，以劳动者、劳动资料、劳动对象及其优化组合的跃升为基本内涵，以全要素生产率大幅提升为核心标志”。今年5月，习近平总书记在济南考察时指出，“因地制宜发展新质生产力”。深入学习习近平总书记重要讲话精神，我们可以厘清两个主要脉络：一是突出技术进步对经济增长的贡献度；二是最终目的是要大幅提高全要素生产率。在讨论和发展新质生产力的时候，为避免认知边界的模糊性，需要进一步甄别和思考。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\">欧阳日辉：</span></strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\">生产力具有鲜明的时代特征，新质生产力是数字经济时代的生产力。新质生产力的显著特点是创新，强调创新起主导作用，包括科技创新、产业创新、业态创新、模式创新、管理创新。我们要从创新的视角来理解新质生产力，发挥数据这个新生产要素的乘数效应，促进生产要素配置创新，促进产学研融通创新，培育科技创新生态激发创新潜能，以科技创新引领产业创新，以原创性、颠覆性技术创新开辟发展新领域新赛道，塑造发展新动能新优势。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\">明雷：</span></strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\">新质生产力的本质是先进生产力。从历史的进程来看，新质生产力的核心是通过创新来驱动社会经济发展，数字化在现代科技革命中具有重要意义。从技术运用来看，数字经济时代，人工智能、物联网、区块链等技术在经济社会发展中得以充分应用，其背后是算法、算力、数据的共同驱动。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">当前，无论是数字产业化还是产业数字化，在我国都有非常丰富的应用场景。而且无论外部环境多么复杂多变，我国经济发展韧性强，拥有完整的工业体系，具体来讲，我国拥有41个工业大类、207个中类、666个小类，这也为数字经济发展打下了坚实基础。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><br/></p><section><section><section><section><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/5W3cq2dzJ1QEf4Edj188j3vGEXQVfTr37F1XcczUB4wu9DjB1sxHJxJvpjgXcbAJYsH2WFHySjdjxNZvDnt5Qg/640?from=appmsg&wxfrom=5&wx_lazy=1&wx_co=1&wx_fmt=other&tp=webp\" class=\"\" alt=\"图片\"/></section><section><section><section><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">问：您认为新质生产力具有哪些时代特征？其在金融业的发展逻辑是什么？</strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><br/></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\">欧阳日辉：</span></strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\">新质生产力的时代特征包括数字技术和数据作为新的生产要素，平台经济的兴起以及科技创新和产业创新的结合，这些特征使得数字经济和数字金融成为推动新质生产力的关键因素。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">新质生产力发展的理论逻辑包括科技创新、动能创新和跨界融合，金融机构需要通过科技和数据的应用来提升全要素生产率。当前，人工智能等技术革命对金融科技产生了深远影响，推动了普惠金融和数字产业金融服务模式的创新。同时，通过新场景、新服务、新模式的创新，推动产业数字化和数字产业化，实现科技、产业、金融的良性循环。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><br/></p><section><section><section><section><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/5W3cq2dzJ1QEf4Edj188j3vGEXQVfTr37F1XcczUB4wu9DjB1sxHJxJvpjgXcbAJYsH2WFHySjdjxNZvDnt5Qg/640?from=appmsg&wxfrom=5&wx_lazy=1&wx_co=1&wx_fmt=other&tp=webp\" class=\"\" alt=\"图片\"/></section><section><section><section><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">问：您认为数字金融如何服务于新质生产力？</strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><br/></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\">杨涛：</span></strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\">数字金融要服务好新质生产力，需要从数字金融的供给侧和需求侧来讨论问题。从数字金融的供给侧来看，数字金融包含了原有金融科技的内涵，也就是新技术带来的金融创新，可能带来新的金融业务、模式、流程或产品，从而大幅提高金融业的效率。在原有的基于金融科技的服务基础上，数字金融进一步突出了数据要素、数字化基础设施的重要价值。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">从数字金融的需求侧来看，发展新质生产力离不开劳动者、生产资料、生产关系、承载产业、市场空间、产业组织等核心要素。一是数字金融如何更有效服务于劳动者的技能改善、能力和服务效率提升，金融活动、金融技术在其中肯定是大有可为的。二是金融业如何更好地用数据要素推动数据资产进行优化升级，这不仅仅带来金融业自身的效率提升、产品与服务的优化，而且还可以促进新的增长模式。三是数字金融对新生产关系的优化升级也带来重大的促进作用，归根结底是为了更有效地组织经济活动、优化资源配置。四是要通过金融自身的数字化转型来服务于产业数字化的提升，推动传统产业的优化升级，更好地服务于数字化引领的新农业、新制造、新服务。五是数字经济本身就强化了规模经济效应，数字经济在改变市场空间的同时离不开金融产品、金融服务的有效支持。六是数字金融结合数字化的力量共同作用于微观产业组织边界的优化，会为新质生产力提供更多具有活力的微观“细胞”。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\">明雷：</span></strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\">新一轮科技革命下，技术的革命性突破和生产要素的创新配置不断催生出新产业、新模式、新业态和新动能。从地方在数字金融领域的发展探索看，有些地区数字经济发展水平相对较低，存在技术基础设施不完善的问题。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">以湖南省为例，当前，全省上下贯彻落实习近平总书记在湖南考察时的重要讲话和指示精神以及新时代推动中部地区崛起座谈会精神。湖南在战略叠加和人才红利转化方面有更多发展空间，希望通过科技创新和开放合作推动湖南的发展，这些将成为湖南以数字金融助力新质生产力发展的新机遇。湖南需要多方面进一步发力。一方面，夯实数字金融基础，将数字技术优势转化为数字金融优势；另一方面，借助数字金融助力产业深度转型升级，加快发展新质生产力。湖南优势产业工程机械、轨道交通、现代农业、文化旅游等转型升级，都需要数字技术赋能，更需要数字金融助力。通过数实融合，实现更加智能化、高效化的发展，进而为经济发展注入新的活力和潜力。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\">欧阳日辉：</span></strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\">数字金融与新质生产力是一种协同发展的关系。一方面，数字金融通过技术革命提供新型金融资本工具，推动科技创新，引导新质生产力向高科技发展；通过交易革命塑造新型数字普惠金融不断深化扩张，推动产业创新，引导新质生产力向高效能发展；通过决策革命重构资源配置决策机制，推动动能创新，引导新质生产力不断跃迁。另一方面，数字金融和新质生产力形成你中有我、和谐共生、共促发展的创新生态系统，推动形成“科技—产业—金融”良性循环的金融新生态，共促千行百业深度转型升级。建议支持鼓励金融机构与科技公司合作开发创新金融产品和服务，不断扩展共建生态创新的场景外延，开辟新赛道、增强新动能、塑造新优势。</span></span></p></section><p></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p> </div> </div> <div class=\"xq_r\"> <dl> <a href=\"874.html\"> <dt><span>05</span><font>2025.12</font></dt> <dd> <h2>展会 | GreatSQL精彩亮相GOTC 2025 共建开源数据库生态新未来</h2> <font>2025.12.05</font> <p></p> </dd> </a> </dl> <dl> <a href=\"873.html\"> <dt><span>05</span><font>2025.12</font></dt> <dd> <h2>解决方案 | 200+系统信创改造！万里数据库助力中信银行信用卡中心实现高效平滑迁移</h2> <font>2025.12.05</font> <p></p> </dd> </a> </dl> <dl> <a href=\"872.html\"> <dt><span>05</span><font>2025.12</font></dt> <dd> <h2>喜报｜中国移动中标三连！万里数据库彰显全域布局实力</h2> <font>2025.12.05</font> <p></p> </dd> </a> </dl> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>",
